<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Features - Rahma Pearl</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<style>
.grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 30px;
}

.feature-item {
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.feature-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
}
</style>
<body>
    <nav class="menu-bar">
        <a href="/">Home</a>   
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h2 style="text-align: center;">Our Premium Features</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card feature-item">
                <h3>🛡️ Safety & Security</h3>
                <p>24/7 CCTV surveillance, Secure Entry, and Night Safety Monitoring.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card feature-item">
                <h3>🍽️ Food & Water</h3>
                <p>Nutritious home-style meals and 24/7 RO Purified drinking water.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card feature-item">
                <h3>✨ Modern Amenities</h3>
                <p>High-speed WiFi, Laundry facilities, and 24/7 Water/Power backup.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card feature-item">
                <h3>📖 Study Environment</h3>
                <p>Silent study atmosphere with individual tables and proper ventilation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>